flowchart TB
    accTitle: Per-PRI DDC scan loop
    accDescr: Each scan record is either a transition gap, kept on the timeline without a DDC call, or a physical PRI that receives one fresh-state DDC call. The loop ends after the last record.

    select{"Next scan record?"}
    gap["Transition gap<br/>Keep on timeline; skip DDC"]
    pri["Physical PRI<br/>One DDC call; fresh local state"]
    more{"More records?"}
    done([End scan])

    select -- "gap" --> gap --> more
    select -- "physical PRI" --> pri --> more
    more -- "yes" --> select
    more -- "no" --> done
